{"assertion":{"kind":"theoretical","text":"Erdős Problem #468: declared status 'open'. Formalized: no. For any $n$ let $D_n$ be the set of sums of the shape $d_1,d_1+d_2,d_1+d_2+d_3,\\ldots$ where $1<d_1<d_2<\\cdots$ are the divisors of $n$.\n\nWhat is the size of $D_n\\backslash \\cup_{m<n}D_m$?\n\nIf $f(N)$ is the minimal $n$ such that $N\\in D_n$ then is it true that $f(N)=o(N)$? Perhaps just for almost all $N$? Prize: no. OEIS: A167485, A387502, A387503. Tags: divisors, number theory."},"claim_id":"vcl_20c08e20803bd7b3405f2f67cb929366bd71456249e30840c3728e785bf5afaf","conditions":[],"created_at":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","evidence":[],"extensions":{"vela.legacy-finding.v1":{"annotations":[],"attachments":[],"confidence":{"basis":"external catalogue record","extraction_confidence":1.0,"kind":"frontier_epistemic","method":"llm_initial","score":0.5},"flags":{"contested":false,"declining":false,"gap":false,"gravity_well":false,"negative_space":false,"retracted":false},"legacy_conditions":{"duration":null,"text":""},"legacy_evidence":{"evidence_spans":[],"method":"erdos_deep","model_system":"n/a","replicated":false,"replication_count":null,"type":"theoretical"},"legacy_links":[],"legacy_provenance":{"authors":[],"doi":null,"extraction":{"extracted_at":"","extractor_version":"","method":"database_import","model":null,"model_version":null},"review":null,"source_type":"database_record","title":"erdos_deep:468","year":null},"previous_version":null,"source_schema":"https://vela.science/schema/finding-bundle/v0.10.0","source_version":1,"updated":null}},"imported_from":{"era":"finding_v0_10","object_id":"vf_58ec2398b39bd1b3","object_root":"sha256:081e9964aef6cc5857f932de032f9498c902c5694a28e7bee520967e8f8f30dd","predecessor_commit":"c236b4fdedb25e0d726e24e2780d50962e4844f7"},"provenance":[{"kind":"database_record","title":"erdos_deep:468"}],"relations":[],"revision":1,"schema":"vela.claim-record.v1"}